{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51977","headline":"沁园春 · 吕岩","name":"沁园春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日南京，今朝天岳，倐焉忽焉。\n指洞庭爲酒，渴时浩饮，君山件枕，醉後高眠。\n谈笑自如，往来无碍，半是风狂半是仙。\n随身在，有一襟风月，两袖云烟。\n人间，放浪多年，又排辨东华第二筵。\n把珊瑚砍倒，栽吾琪树，天河放浅，种我金莲。\n搥碎王京，踢翻蓬岛，稽首虚皇玉案前。\n无难事，信功成八百，行满三千。\n（隆庆《岳州府志》十八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}